was born in Juiz de Fora, a city near Belo Horizonte. My parents and my  
brother still live in Juiz de Fora, but in Belo Horizonte lives most of my  
relatives. It's a pleasure to talk to someone who knows a "mineira" city!
But you are a french, don't you?

I search for a propaganda text about lojban. Perhaps that on the front  
page of lojban.org? I don't know.
As I see, you certainly know portuguese. I'm also a esperantist, and you  
can talk to me also in this language.

How did you learn lojban?

Obrigado mais uma vez pela atenção e, se você quiser, podemos ir  
conversando também em português.

Fred


